Subject: CONFIDENTIAL: Breakthrough in Heavy-Duty Powertrain Efficiency \'96 0ms Torque Disruption Technology
\f1\b0 \

\f0\b Dear Sir/Madam,
\f1\b0 \
We are introducing a new generation of powertrain architecture for heavy-duty transport: the 
\f0\b Sigma-Sync Orbital Drive (SSOD)
\f1\b0 . This system is engineered to eliminate the primary efficiency loss in diesel engines: torque disruption during gear shifts and the subsequent collapse of turbocharger boost pressure.\
The technology is currently under patent protection, and we are offering your organization the opportunity to evaluate the integration of this system into your future vehicle platforms.\
\

